<title>USA: Empire District Electric to offer bonds.</title>
<headline>Empire District Electric to offer bonds.</headline>
<dateline>JOPLIN, Mo. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire District Electric Co said Tuesday it will offer $25 million of its First Mortgage Bonds through Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>The bonds will pay 7.2 percent when they become due in 2016, said Empire District Electric.</p>
<p>The utility provides electrical service to a 10,000-square-mile area in parts of Missouri, Kansas, Oklahoma and Arkansas. Empire also provides water service in three incorporated communities in Missouri.</p>
<p>-- ((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
